 LogRumba←{
     ⍝ ⍺ ←→ Server or Client
     ⍝ ⍵ ←→ Rumba Log message
     ⍝ ← ←→ 0
     t←⍺.LogFileTie
     ~⍺.LogRumba∧t<0:0
     ld←LogDate QTS
     d←'Rumba: ',ld,' ',⍵,CrLf
     u←⎕UCS'UTF-8'⎕UCS d
     ~t∊⎕NNUMS:0                    ⍝ The application may have untied the log file by now.
     _←u ⎕NAPPEND t                 ⍝ No function call between these two: that keeps them free of thread switches
     0
 }
